        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sbn0",
          "text": "Coping with the pain and suffering of being in a car accident can take extensive therapy and counseling. Some survivors experience emotional effects for the rest of their lives – especially those who sustained life-changing injuries or watched a loved one die. These effects can impact the victim’s ability to enjoy daily life, participate in favorite hobbies and activities, and maintain relationships with others.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
